      "instruction": "Explore the repository and understand the issue described in the problem statement.\n\n{{problem_statement}}\n\nExplore the repo structure, read relevant source files, identify the area of code related to the issue, and form a hypothesis about the root cause.\n\nReturn a STRUCTURED summary:\n```\nPROJECT: <project name and description>\nISSUE SUMMARY: <concise summary of the reported issue>\nKEY SYMPTOMS: <observable symptoms of the bug>\nRELEVANT FILES: <list of relevant source files>\nROOT CAUSE HYPOTHESIS: <your initial hypothesis>\n```\n",
